  "rdfs:comment": {
    "de": [
      "Das Hotel-Restaurant le Jabron befindet sich am Ortsausgang von La Bégude de Mazenc."
    ],
    "en": [
      "The Hotel and Restaurant \"le Jabron\" is situated on the way out of the village of La Bégude de Mazenc. It is surrounded by lavender fields and benefits from the famous microclimate of Dieulefit."
